# The half of the toward-the-hour clock.  The hour it follows stands in the
# GENITIVE and is the hour being APPROACHED, so ორის ნახევარი is half toward
# two == 01:30 -- en.wiktionary.org glosses that very phrase "half past one".
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E1%83%9C%E1%83%90%E1%83%AE%E1%83%94%E1%83%95%E1%83%90%E1%83%A0%E1%83%98
ნახევარი
